    <body>
      <div type="clause" n="11.4">
        <head><ref type="lawCode" target="law:Af">Af</ref> 11.4</head>
        <ab type="selectedText" xml:lang="und">Gif he mon teo, geladie (ge)hie be sixtegum hida, oððe ðolige be healfe þære bote.</ab>
        <ab type="translation" xml:lang="en">If she is accused [of having lain with another man], let her clear herself by [an oath in the value of] sixty hides, or forfeit half the compensation.</ab>
        <ab type="secondTranslation" xml:lang="en">If she is accused [of having previously lain with a man], she shall clear herself by [an oath of] 60 hides, or lose half the compensation due to her.</ab>
        <ab type="supplementaryText" xml:lang="und">Gif mon teo hy, geladige hy be LX hida, oþþe ðolige be healfe ðære bote.</ab>
      </div>
    </body>
